    "heading": "Spellcasting Focus",
    "lineStart": 13671,
    "lineEnd": 13673
  },
  "section": "8.136",
  "rulesText": "A Spellcasting Focus is an object that certain creatures can use in place of a spell's Material components if those materials aren't consumed by the spell and don't have a cost specified. Some classes allow its members to use certain types of Spellcasting Focuses. See also \"Spells\" (\"Casting Spells\")."
}
